# Cloudflare Workers static asset response headers for the schema. See DECISIONS.md D-30 and D-41.
# This Worker serves only https://fpds.football/schema/* through a route. fpds-football/site serves all other paths.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/schema/*
  Content-Type: application/schema+json
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
